  "description": "There is a café on the first floor of a one-room apartment. This is a café where seven men and women who are having a hard time in life gather.\n\nMasato is a sex addict who cannot fall in love. Ryohei likes to love, but is not good at being loved. They only had a physical relationship, but one day, Ryohei's confession, \"I think I like you,\" threatens to upset the equilibrium of their relationship.\n\nA twisted relationship between two twisted people.\n\n(Source: Copin Comics)",
